  "title": "Johnny Marzetti IV",
  "description": "A savory blend of ground beef, onion, mushrooms, garlic, pepper, sugar and Worcestershire is simmered with tomato sauce and layered with noodles and sharp Cheddar cheese to make a zesty baked casserole.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie"
